{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../encryption/encrypt/", "title": "Encrypt"}, "next": {"link": "../utils/helpers/", "title": "Helpers"}, "title": "Error", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"module-error\">\n<span id=\"error\"></span><h1>Error<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-error\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Error classes for the SDK.\nThese exceptions provide specific error types for different failure scenarios.</p>\n<section id=\"exceptions\">\n<h2>Exceptions<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#exceptions\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.AccessTokenError\" title=\"error.AccessTokenError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AccessTokenError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when there's an issue with access tokens.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.AccessTokenForConnectionError\" title=\"error.AccessTokenForConnectionError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AccessTokenForConnectionError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error when retrieving access tokens for a specific connection fails.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.AnonymousSessionCreateError\" title=\"error.AnonymousSessionCreateError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AnonymousSessionCreateError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error thrown when creating or re-minting an anonymous session fails.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.AnonymousSessionError\" title=\"error.AnonymousSessionError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AnonymousSessionError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Base class for anonymous session errors.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.AnonymousSessionTokenError\" title=\"error.AnonymousSessionTokenError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AnonymousSessionTokenError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error thrown when get_token() fails for reasons other than session expiry.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.ApiError\" title=\"error.ApiError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ApiError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when an API request to Auth0 fails.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.Auth0Error\" title=\"error.Auth0Error\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Auth0Error</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Base class for all Auth0 SDK errors.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.BackchannelLogoutError\" title=\"error.BackchannelLogoutError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">BackchannelLogoutError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised during backchannel logout processing.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.ConfigurationError\" title=\"error.ConfigurationError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ConfigurationError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when SDK configuration is invalid.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.CustomTokenExchangeError\" title=\"error.CustomTokenExchangeError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CustomTokenExchangeError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised during custom token exchange operations.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.DomainResolverError\" title=\"error.DomainResolverError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DomainResolverError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when domain resolver function fails or returns invalid value.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.EnterpriseConnectError\" title=\"error.EnterpriseConnectError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">EnterpriseConnectError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when a session or token method is called on a client</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.InvalidArgumentError\" title=\"error.InvalidArgumentError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InvalidArgumentError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when a given argument is an invalid value.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.IssuerValidationError\" title=\"error.IssuerValidationError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">IssuerValidationError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when token issuer validation fails.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.MfaApiError\" title=\"error.MfaApiError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaApiError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Base class for MFA API errors.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.MfaChallengeError\" title=\"error.MfaChallengeError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaChallengeError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error thrown when initiating an MFA challenge fails.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.MfaEnrollmentError\" title=\"error.MfaEnrollmentError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaEnrollmentError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error thrown when enrolling an authenticator fails.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.MfaListAuthenticatorsError\" title=\"error.MfaListAuthenticatorsError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaListAuthenticatorsError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error thrown when listing authenticators fails.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.MfaRequiredError\" title=\"error.MfaRequiredError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaRequiredError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error thrown when MFA step-up is required during token refresh.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.MfaTokenExpiredError\" title=\"error.MfaTokenExpiredError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaTokenExpiredError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error thrown when the encrypted MFA token has expired.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.MfaTokenInvalidError\" title=\"error.MfaTokenInvalidError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaTokenInvalidError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error thrown when the encrypted MFA token is invalid or tampered.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.MfaVerifyError\" title=\"error.MfaVerifyError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaVerifyError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error thrown when MFA verification fails.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\" title=\"error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MissingRequiredArgumentError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when a required argument is missing.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.MissingTransactionError\" title=\"error.MissingTransactionError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MissingTransactionError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when a required transaction is missing.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.MyAccountApiError\" title=\"error.MyAccountApiError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MyAccountApiError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when an API request to My Account API fails.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.OrganizationTokenValidationError\" title=\"error.OrganizationTokenValidationError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">OrganizationTokenValidationError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Raised when org_id or org_name claim in the ID token fails validation</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.PasskeyError\" title=\"error.PasskeyError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PasskeyError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised during passkey authentication operations.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.PasswordlessStartError\" title=\"error.PasswordlessStartError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PasswordlessStartError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when POST /passwordless/start fails.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.PasswordlessVerifyError\" title=\"error.PasswordlessVerifyError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PasswordlessVerifyError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when the passwordless OTP token exchange fails.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.PollingApiError\" title=\"error.PollingApiError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PollingApiError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when a polling API request to Auth0 fails.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.SessionExpiredError\" title=\"error.SessionExpiredError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">SessionExpiredError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when a session is rejected at login because its</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.StartLinkUserError\" title=\"error.StartLinkUserError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StartLinkUserError</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error raised when user linking process fails to start.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section id=\"classes\">\n<h2>Classes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#classes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.AccessTokenErrorCode\" title=\"error.AccessTokenErrorCode\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AccessTokenErrorCode</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error codes for access token operations.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.AccessTokenForConnectionErrorCode\" title=\"error.AccessTokenForConnectionErrorCode\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AccessTokenForConnectionErrorCode</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error codes for connection-specific token operations.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.CustomTokenExchangeErrorCode\" title=\"error.CustomTokenExchangeErrorCode\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CustomTokenExchangeErrorCode</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error codes for custom token exchange operations.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.EnterpriseConnectErrorCode\" title=\"error.EnterpriseConnectErrorCode\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">EnterpriseConnectErrorCode</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error code for the Enterprise Connect misuse guard.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.PasskeyErrorCode\" title=\"error.PasskeyErrorCode\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PasskeyErrorCode</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error codes for passkey operations.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.PasswordlessErrorCode\" title=\"error.PasswordlessErrorCode\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PasswordlessErrorCode</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Error codes for passwordless operations.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section