ame\"><span class=\"pre\">error.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">CustomTokenExchangeError</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">code</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">message</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">cause</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.CustomTokenExchangeError\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.Auth0Error\" title=\"error.Auth0Error\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Auth0Error</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Error raised during custom token exchange operations.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.CustomTokenExchangeError.cause\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">cause</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.CustomTokenExchangeError.cause\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.CustomTokenExchangeError.code\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">code</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.CustomTokenExchangeError.code\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.CustomTokenExchangeError.name\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'CustomTokenExchangeError'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.CustomTokenExchangeError.name\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py exception\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.DomainResolverError\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">exception</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">error.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">DomainResolverError</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">message</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">original_error</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">Exception</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.DomainResolverError\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.Auth0Error\" title=\"error.Auth0Error\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Auth0Error</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Error raised when domain resolver function fails or returns invalid value.</p>\n<p>This error indicates an issue with the custom domain resolver function\nprovided for MCD (Multiple Custom Domains) support.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.DomainResolverError.code\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">code</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'domain_resolver_error'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.DomainResolverError.code\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.DomainResolverError.name\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'DomainResolverError'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.DomainResolverError.name\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.DomainResolverError.original_error\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">original_error</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.DomainResolverError.original_error\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py exception\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.EnterpriseConnectError\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">exception</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">error.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">EnterpriseConnectError</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">code</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">message</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">cause</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.EnterpriseConnectError\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.Auth0Error\" title=\"error.Auth0Error\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Auth0Error</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Error raised when a session or token method is called on a client\nconfigured for Enterprise Connect, where the SDK owns no session.</p>\n<p>Parents Auth0Error rather than ApiError because the refusal makes no\nrequest to Auth0, so there is no upstream error body to carry.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.EnterpriseConnectError.cause\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">cause</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.EnterpriseConnectError.cause\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.EnterpriseConnectError.code\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">code</span></sp