an class=\"pre\">MfaEnrollmentError</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">message</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">cause</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.MfaEnrollmentError\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.MfaApiError\" title=\"error.MfaApiError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaApiError</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Error thrown when enrolling an authenticator fails.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py exception\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.MfaListAuthenticatorsError\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">exception</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">error.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaListAuthenticatorsError</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">message</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">cause</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.MfaListAuthenticatorsError\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.MfaApiError\" title=\"error.MfaApiError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaApiError</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Error thrown when listing authenticators fails.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py exception\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.MfaRequiredError\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">exception</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">error.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaRequiredError</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">message</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">mfa_token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">mfa_requirements</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">cause</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">Exception</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.MfaRequiredError\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.AccessTokenError\" title=\"error.AccessTokenError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AccessTokenError</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Error thrown when MFA step-up is required during token refresh.</p>\n<p>Contains an encrypted mfa_token that can be passed to MfaClient methods.\nThis error is raised in get_access_token() when the token endpoint returns\n\u2018mfa_required\u2019.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.MfaRequiredError.mfa_requirements\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">mfa_requirements</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.MfaRequiredError.mfa_requirements\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.MfaRequiredError.mfa_token\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">mfa_token</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.MfaRequiredError.mfa_token\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py exception\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.MfaTokenExpiredError\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">exception</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">error.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaTokenExpiredError</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.MfaTokenExpiredError\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.Auth0Error\" title=\"error.Auth0Error\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Auth0Error</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Error thrown when the encrypted MFA token has expired.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.MfaTokenExpiredError.code\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">code</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'mfa_token_expired'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.MfaTokenExpiredError.code\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py exception\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.MfaTokenInvalidError\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">exception</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">error.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaTokenInvalidError</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.MfaTokenInvalidError\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.Auth0Error\" title=\"error.Auth0Error\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Auth0Error</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Error thrown when the encrypted MFA token is invalid or tampered.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.MfaTokenInvalidError.code\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">code</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'mfa_token_invalid'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.MfaTokenInvalidError.code\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py exception\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"error.MfaVerifyError\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">exception</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">error.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaVerifyError</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">message</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">cause</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#error.MfaVerifyError\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#error.MfaApiError\" title=\"error.MfaApiError\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaApiError</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Error thrown when MFA verification fails.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py excepti